<title>JAPAN: Hikari Tsushin jumps on share-split plan.</title>
<headline>Hikari Tsushin jumps on share-split plan.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Hikari Tsushin Inc surged on Wednesday morning, cheered by its announcement on Tuesday of a share-split plan, traders said.</p>
<p>Hikari Tsushin said it plans a 1.5-for-1 share split on October 17 for shareholders as of August 31.</p>
<p>At 0103 GMT, the share price was up 600 yen at 10,600 yen. Its trading volume was 31,700 shares.  </p>
<p>Hikari Tsushin is a provider of telecommunications services.</p>
